## Why This Is Asked
Tests the candidate's ability to enforce data residency, design cross-region reads for hot tenants, and plan DR while maintaining performance.

## Key Concepts
- Data residency policies and region tagging
- Per-tenant schema isolation and access controls
- Cross-region analytics cloning and cost/performance trade-offs
- DR testing and regulatory auditing

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode: routing by tenant region
switch (tenant.region) {
  case 'us-east-1': routeTo(usEastClient); break;
  case 'eu-west-1': routeTo(euWestClient); break;
  default: routeTo(analyticsClone);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you enforce tenant relocation across regions without downtime?
- How would you audit data-access for regulatory purposes?
